<img alt="Smooth Tinker's Gear" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Smooth Tinker's Gear</span></a> &amp; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77546/sparkling-tinkers-gear">
<img alt="Sparkling Tinker's Gear" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sparkling Tinker's Gear</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="crafting-professions">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mace_39.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Professions &amp; Crafted Gear for Discipline Priests</span></h2>The gap between professions is smaller this expansion than in the past so you have more flexibility.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="engineering">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_engineering.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Engineering for Discipline Priests</h4>Engineering is a multi-faceted profession that offers a range of benefits, including:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=126731/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a>: An enchant you attach to your gloves that gives you an on-use Intellect increase. Can be combined with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=109964/spirit-shell">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_shaman_astralshift.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirit Shell</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77533/lightweight-retinal-armor">
<img alt="Lightweight Retinal Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_goggles_pandariatradeskill_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweight Retinal Armor</span></a>: A pre-raid helm that you can socket with two secondaries of your choice - Generally Crit and Spirit.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>: A sprint that's so ubiquitous across Classic that it's sometimes baked into raid strategies.</div></li></ul>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="blacksmithing">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_blacksmithing.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Blacksmithing for Discipline Priests</h4>Blacksmithing gives you two extra sockets: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_socketedbracer.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55641/socket-gloves">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_addsocketglove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Gloves</span></a> - a flexible bonus since you can socket either pure Intellect, or Intellect + a secondary. The power also isn't conditional on anything else so it's active at all times.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="alchemy">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_alchemy.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Alchemy for Discipline Priests</h4>Alchemy offers two bonuses: a strong pre-raid trinket (<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=75274/zen-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Zen Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_scorchedstone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zen Alchemist Stone</span></a>) and 320 Intellect whenever we drink a flask. Alchemists also get <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=75525/alchemists-flask">
<img alt="Alchemist's Flask" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_endlesspotion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alchemist's Flask</span></a> which gives you the Intellect bonus even if you aren't using a big flask - useful for when you're questing or doing casual dungeon content.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="leatherworking">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_profession_leatherworking.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Leatherworking for Discipline Priests</h4>Leatherworking gives you an early intellect enchant: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=124552/fur-lining-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pelt_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Intellect</span></a>. You also gain <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=29530/drums-of-speed">
